    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wyse Residential is delighted to introduce Apartment 107, 35-38 Mountjoy Square to the market. This attractive two bedroom apartment is located in the popular Mountjoy Square. This third floor apartment comprises of an entrance hallway, two bedrooms, bathroom, living room and kitchen. In addition to this, there is one designated car parking space. This is situated in the development's underground car park.  \r\n\r\nThe subject property is in an ideal location with an array of amenities located within a leisurely stroll. Shops, restaurants and cafes on O'Connell Street, Capel Street and Henry Street as well as Grafton Street are all within walking distance of the property. The property is easily accessed by public transport with the main bus routes located on your doorstep at Mountjoy Square and the Dart and Train at Connolly and Drumcondra stations are also within easy reach. Additionally, the Luas can be accessed at Parnell Street."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway:\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway. \r\n\r\nLiving Room: 4.88m x 2.57m\r\nBright room with feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.26m x 1.44m \r\nFitted units incorporating oven, extractor fan, washer/dryer, sink and fridge/freezer. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.82m x 2.22m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.82m x 1.99m\r\nSingle bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom:  3.27m x 1.44m \r\nPartially tiled room incorporating a bath with shower fitting, wc and whb."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-An attractive two bedroom, one bathroom third floor apartment, overlooking the historic Mountjoy Square.\r\n-Situated in an ideal location at the heart of Dublin City Centre, with a host of amenities within walking distance.\r\n-One designated underground car parking space.\r\n-Electric central heating.\r\n-Current annual service charge is €3,335. Option of €100 reduction if paid in full by end of February each year."
      },
      {
